[0.001, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "  \u001b[0;36;40mThe main objective in The Clans is to destroy the opposition.  You do\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\r"]
[0.002, "o", "  this not only by improving your clan by fighting, gaining gold and\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "  experience but also through your empire.  Increase the size of your\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "  empire and form alliances as well!\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "  \u001b[1;34mIf this game is in an InterBBS league, "]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[0;36;40myou may wish to play the game as"]
[0.0, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "  \"whole\" BBS.  This means having the all players who play The Clans on this\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "  BBS unite (by choosing similar Clan Symbols usually) and travel onto other\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "  BBSes with the intent of destroying everything in sight.  Another way to\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "  play is to simply attack other villages through village empire wars.\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "  \u001b[1;37mGood luck!  And remember: destroy everything.\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[30m[End of Intro]\n\r"]
[0.002, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\n\r<\u001b[0;31;40mpaused"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1;30m"]
[0.0, "o", ">"]
