[0.0, "o", "\u001b[36m"]
[0.0, "o", "Enter option"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1m"]
[0.0, "o", "> \u001b[0;37;40m"]
[0.0, "o", "                      \b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\b\u001b[1m\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\r"]
[0.0, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.002, "o", " \u001b[34mCombat\u001b[0;36;40m\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", " Combat in The Clans is unique.  Unlike other games, you control not one\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", " character but four.  In combat, you will \"run through\" each of the characters\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", " and decide what he should do in terms of turns.  The character (on the\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", " enemy's or your side) with the most agility goes first and the one with\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", " the second most goes next and so on.\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", " \u001b[1;34mExperience \u001b[0;36;40m"]
[0.0, "o", "is gained through the actual combat and NOT afterwards.\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\r"]
[0.001, "o", "   Each move you make in combat will result in an experience point granted\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "   to the character you are controlling.  Therefore, good \"moves\" will result\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "   in more experience which is gained faster.\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", " \u001b[1;34mFollowers "]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[0;36;40m"]
[0.0, "o", "who witness your combat will join your following and can later"]
[0.0, "o", "\n\r"]
[0.002, "o", "   be used as troops to attack other clans in \"clan wars.\"\n\r"]
[0.001, "o", "\n\r\u001b[1;30m<"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[0;31;40m"]
[0.0, "o", "paused"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1;30m"]
[0.0, "o", ">"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[0;36;40m"]
[2.487, "o", "\r  "]
